{
  "id": "linux_smarthome_981",
  "instruction": "Close out the current home-automation change window. Use `/tmp/window/policy.docx` on the first Linux machine and the live SmartHome state to complete the decision and result columns in `/tmp/window/board.xlsx` on the second; execute only a still-open feasible change, leaving blocked, expired, and already-applied devices unchanged.",
